</span><span begin="00:23.872" end="00:24.096">with </span><span begin="00:24.096" end="00:24.665">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.665" end="00:26.505"><span begin="00:24.665" end="00:24.897">Till </span><span begin="00:24.897" end="00:25.216">I </span><span begin="00:25.216" end="00:26.505">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.626" end="00:31.849"><span begin="00:28.626" end="00:28.881">'Cause </span><span begin="00:28.881" end="00:29.226">I'm </span><span begin="00:29.226" end="00:30.145">falling </span><span begin="00:30.145" end="00:30.569">for </span><span begin="00:30.569" end="00:31.009">you </span><span begin="00:31.009" end="00:31.849">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.817" end="00:36.176"><span begin="00:32.817" end="00:33.441">Holding </span><span begin="00:33.441" end="00:33.761">back </span><span begin="00:33.761" end="00:34.081">my </span><span begin="00:34.081" end="00:34.353">words </span><span begin="00:34.353" end="00:34.593">'cause </span><span begin="00:34.593" end="00:34.841">I'm </span><span begin="00:34.841" end="00:35.226">afraid </span><span begin="00:35.226" end="00:35.569">of </span><span begin="00:35.569" end="00:36.176">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.649" end="00:39.850"><span begin="00:36.649" end="00:36.986">We </span><span begin="00:36.986" end="00:37.273">don't </span><span begin="00:37.273" end="00:37.545">gotta </span><span begin="00:37.545" end="00:37.920">hurt </span><span begin="00:37.920" end="00:38.193">you </span><span begin="00:38.193" end="00:38.465">know </span><span begin="00:38.465" end="00:38.736">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.736" end="00:39.121">leaving </span><span begin="00:39.121" end="00:39.850">soon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.041" end="00:41.833"><span begin="00:40.041" end="00:40.273">We </span><span begin="00:40.273" end="00:40.593">both </span><span begin="00:40.785" end="00:41.833">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.602" end="00:46.952"><span begin="00:43.602" end="00:43.905">I </span><span begin="00:43.905" end="00:44.321">can't </span><span begin="00:44.321" end="00:45.393">fall </span><span begin="00:45.393" end="00:45.752">for </span><span begin="00:45.752" end="00:46.217">you </span><span begin="00:46.217" end="00:46.952">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.297" end="00:51.585"><span begin="00:48.297" end="00:48.545">You </span><span begin="00:48.545" end="00:48.785">made </span><span begin="00:48.785" end="00:49.137">a </span><span begin="00:49.137" end="00:49.554">promise </span><span begin="00:49.802" end="00:50.185">'bout </span><span begin="00:50.185" end="00:50.449">all </span><span begin="00:50.449" end="00:50.713">we </span><span begin="00:50.713" end="00:51.065">could </span><span begin="00:51.065" end="00:51.585">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.961" end="00:55.657"><span begin="00:51.961" end="00:52.241">Eyes </span><span begin="00:52.241" end="00:52.601">were </span><span begin="00:52.601" end="00:52.913">wide </span><span begin="00:52.913" end="00:53.377">open </span><span begin="00:53.584" end="00:54.017">but </span><span begin="00:54.017" end="00:54.320">I </span><span begin="00:54.320" end="00:54.753">couldn't </span><span begin="00:54.753" end="00:55.657">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.905" end="00:57.489"><span begin="00:55.905" end="00:56.265">Losing </span><span begin="00:56.265" end="00:56.721">you </span><span begin="00:56.721" end="00:57.489">slowly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.084" end="00:59.612"><span begin="00:58.084" end="00:58.356">Could </span><span begin="00:58.356" end="00:58.660">you </span><span begin="00:58.660" end="00:59.116">show </span><span begin="00:59.116" end="00:59.612">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.852" end="01:01.636"><span begin="00:59.852" end="01:00.076">I </span><span begin="01:00.076" end="01:00.308">bet </span><span begin="01:00.308" end="01:00.628">you </span><span begin="01:00.628" end="01:01.636">won't</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.732" end="01:04.323"><span begin="01:01.732" end="01:01.988">Say </span><span begin="01:01.988" end="01:02.428">something </span><span begin="01:02.428" end="01:02.996">don't </span><span begin="01:02.996" end="01:03.244">let </span><span begin="01:03.244" end="01:03.556">me </span><span begin="01:03.556" end="01:04.323">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.436" end="01:08.340"><span begin="01:05.436" end="01:05.724">I </span><span begin="01:05.724" end="01:05.972">used </span><span begin="01:05.972" end="01:06.332">to </span><span begin="01:06.332" end="01:06.748">call </span><span begin="01:06.748" end="01:07.148">you </span><span begin="01:07.148" end="01:07.460">my </span><span begin="01:07.460" end="01:08.340">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.148" end="01:12.236"><span begin="01:09.148" end="01:09.436">We </span><span begin="01:09.436" end="01:09.772">don't </span><span begin="01:09.772" end="01:10.069">got </span><span begin="01:10.069" end="01:10.429">love </span><span begin="01:10.429" end="01:10.741">like </span><span begin="01:10.741" end="01:11.036">we </span><span begin="01:11.036" end="01:11.700">used </span><span begin="01:11.932" end="01:12.236">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.932" end="01:15.904"><span begin="01:12.932" end="01:13.196">But </span><span begin="01:13.196" end="01:13.516">I'll </span><span begin="01:13.516" end="01:13.820">still </span><span begin="01:13.820" end="01:14.181">keep </span><span begin="01:14.181" end="01:14.547">holding </span><span begin="01:14.547" end="01:15.100">you </span><span begin="01:15.100" end="01:15.904">close</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.952" end="01:19.760"><span begin="01:16.952" end="01:17.224">Say </span><span begin="01:17.224" end="01:17.648">something </span><span begin="01:17.648" end="01:18.040">don't </span><span begin="01:18.040" end="01:18.344">let </span><span begin="01:18.344" end="01:18.704">me </span><span begin="01:18.704" end="01:19.760">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.424" end="01:23.473"><span begin="01:20.424" end="01:20.688">It's </span><span begin="01:20.688" end="01:21.072">harder </span><span begin="01:21.072" end="01:21.360">to </span><span begin="01:21.360" end="01:21.688">hold </span><span begin="01:21.688" end="01:22.032">on </span><span begin="01:22.032" end="01:22.361">to </span><span begin="01:22.361" end="01:23.473">hope</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.128" end="01:27.536"><span begin="01:24.128" end="01:24.440">'Cause </span><span begin="01:24.440" end="01:24.744">we </span><span begin="01:24.744" end="01:25.064">don't </span><span begin="01:25.064" end="01:25.368">got </span><span begin="01:25.368" end="01:25.744">love </span><span begin="01:25.744" end="01:26.048">like </span><span begin="01:26.048" end="01:26.368">we </span><span begin="01:26.368" end="01:26.928">used </span><span begin="01:26.928" end="01:27.536">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.128" end="01:31.256"><span begin="01:28.128" end="01:28.400">But </span><span begin="01:28.400" end="01:28.695">you're </span><span begin="01:28.695" end="01:28.992">still </span><span begin="01:28.992" end="01:29.280">a </span><span begin="01:29.280" end="01:29.584">part </span><span begin="01:29.584" end="01:29.864">of </span><span begin="01:29.864" end="01:30.232">my </span><span begin="01:30.232" end="01:31.256">soul</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.151" end="01:36.951"><span begin="01:34.151" end="01:34.439">Maybe </span><span begin="01:34.439" end="01:34.719">one </span><span begin="01:34.719" end="01:34.983">more </span><span begin="01:34.983" end="01:35.263">dance </span><span begin="01:35.263" end="01:35.511">will </span><span begin="01:35.511" end="01:35.743">make </span><span begin="01:35.743" end="01:35.975">us </span><span begin="01:35.975" end="01:36.215">see </span><span begin="01:36.215" end="01:36.463">it </span><span begin="01:36.463" end="01:36.951">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.600" end="01:40.688"><span begin="01:37.600" end="01:37.832">You </span><span begin="01:37.832" end="01:38.080">think </span><span begin="01:38.080" end="01:38.336">you're </span><span begin="01:38.336" end="01:38.592">a </span><span begin="01:38.592" end="01:38.840">mess </span><span begin="01:38.840" end="01:39.136">but </span><span begin="01:39.136" end="01:39.376">girl </span><span begin="01:39.376" end="01:39.600">I </span><span begin="01:39.600" end="01:39.848">feel </span><span begin="01:39.848" end="01:40.160">it </span><span begin="01:40.160" end="01:40.688">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.912" end="01:42.792"><span begin="01:40.912" end="01:41.168">We're </span><span begin="01:41.168" end="01:41.552">not </span><span begin="01:41.552" end="01:42.792">broken</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.464" end="01:48.384"><span begin="01:44.464" end="01:44.864">We're </span><span begin="01:44.864" end="01:45.248">just </span><span begin="01:45.248" end="01:45.520">lost </span><span begin="01:45.520" end="01:45.944">in </span><span begin="01:45.944" end="01:46.272">the </span><span begin="01:46.272" end="01:46.608">heat </span><span begin="01:46.608" end="01:47.000">of </span><span begin="01:47.000" end="01:47.336">it </span><span begin="01:47.336" end="01:47.944">all </span><span begin="01:47.944" end="01:48.384">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.384" end="01:52.384"><span begin="01:48.384" end="01:48.671">Oh </span><span begin="01:48.671" end="01:49.000">but </span><span begin="01:49.000" end="01:49.256">then </span><span begin="01:49.256" end="01:49.528">you </span><span begin="01:49.528" end="01:49.800">waste </span><span begin="01:49.800" end="01:50.096">it </span><span begin="01:50.096" end="01:50.383">on </span><span begin="01:50.383" end="01:50.672">me </span><span begin="01:50.672" end="01:50.992">and </span><span begin="01:50.992" end="01:51.280">I </span><